⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
338 calories 48g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Chocolate Therapy Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 140 recipes like this one!

- 1 @Quest Nutrition Chocolate Protein Milkshake
- 20-25g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 10g cocoa powder
- 7-10g chocolate jello pudding mix
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins/Toppings:
- 3 @OREO Thins (cream removed)
338 cal 30g C, 7g F, 48g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting (if powdery)
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the Oreos
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

